    "summary": "Seer Council errata: **Unshrouded Truth** gets a new Target and Effect. Target: one of your **ASURYANI INFANTRY** units (no **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** units) standing within 9\" of a friendly **ASURYANI PSYKER** model, provided that so far this phase it has not been picked to move and was not placed on the battlefield. Effect: move it into **Strategic Reserves**; it gains **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** and has to arrive with an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during this phase. This wording does not say whether that move is allowed in your first turn.",
